    "document": "WIKI/deep_learning.md",
    "chunk_text": "neural networks were used to produce molecules that were validated experimentally all the way into mice.  Customer relationship management Deep reinforcement learning has been used to approximate the value of possible direct marketing actions, defined in terms of RFM variables. The estimated value function was shown to have a natural interpretation as customer lifetime value.  Recommendation systems Recommendation systems have used deep learning to extract meaningful features for a latent factor model for content-based music and journal recommendations. Multi-view deep learning has been applied for learning user preferences from multiple domains. The model uses a hybrid collaborative and content-based approach and enhances recommendations",
    "chunk_token_count": 103,
